1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,164
Six that Nepali candidates often reverse.

2
00:00:03,164 --> 00:00:05,885
Not do a mistake, but make a mistake.

3
00:00:05,885 --> 00:00:08,541
Not give an exam, but take an exam.

4
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:10,911
Not do a decision, but make one.

5
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:13,320
Not say a lie, but tell a lie.

6
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,872
Not open the light, but turn on the light.

7
00:00:15,872 --> 00:00:18,671
And not strong rain, but heavy rain.

